    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000ss6g](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000ss6g) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 72.962 depth occurred on Jun 11 2026 60km S of Sarangani. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 4.8685 longitude 125.4495. It impacted 2 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
